cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit or build on its workflow, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "3D-Assisted Illustration: a stage-gated, verified Blender workflow"
abstract: >-
  A Blender Python toolkit that builds a 3D base for digital painting and concept art,
  renders the passes and masks a painter needs, and writes them as a layered PSD/ORA
  paintover file. It runs headless, every build is seeded, and every stage (blockout,
  assemble, materials, lighting, render) is checked with numeric asserts. It is written
  to be run and extended by AI coding agents.
authors:
